{"_comment":"sing-box 分流规则（复制粘贴即可用）。来源：GitHub 官方 SagerNet/sing-geosite + sing-geoip，二进制 .srs。用 法：把下面 dns 和 route 两段复制，粘贴到你的 sing-box JSON 配置里，替换掉原来的 dns / route 两段。出站名必须是“节点选择”（selector）和“自动选择”（urltest），不要改名，否则规则会找不到出站。","dns":{"final":"dns-proxy","rules":[{"rule_set":["geosite-cn"],"server":"dns-direct"},{"outbound":"any","server":"dns-proxy"}],"servers":[{"address":"223.5.5.5","detour":"direct","tag":"dns-direct"},{"address":"8.8.8.8","detour":"节点选择","tag":"dns-proxy"}]},"route":{"final":"自动选择","rule_set":[{"download_detour":"节点选择","format":"binary","tag":"geosite-ads","type":"remote","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SagerNet/sing-geosite/rule-set/geosite-ads.srs"},{"download_detour":"节点选择","format":"binary","tag":"geosite-cn","type":"remote","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SagerNet/sing-geosite/rule-set/geosite-cn.srs"},{"download_detour":"节点选择","format":"binary","tag":"geosite-private","type":"remote","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SagerNet/sing-geosite/rule-set/geosite-private.srs"},{"download_detour":"节点选择","format":"binary","tag":"geoip-cn","type":"remote","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SagerNet/sing-geoip/rule-set/geoip-cn.srs"},{"download_detour":"节点选择","format":"binary","tag":"geoip-private","type":"remote","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SagerNet/sing-geoip/rule-set/geoip-private.srs"}],"rules":[{"action":"route","outbound":"block","rule_set":["geosite-ads"]},{"action":"route","outbound":"direct","rule_set":["geosite-private","geoip-private"]},{"action":"route","outbound":"direct","rule_set":["geosite-cn","geoip-cn"]},{"action":"route","outbound":"自动选择"}]}}